":"BOL","lat":-16.65001,"lon":-68.29995,"kind":"city","region":"BO-L","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"比亞查 · 地点概要","geo":"比亚查是玻利维亚的城镇，由拉巴斯省负责管辖，位于该国西部，该城镇也是玻利维亚的铁路枢纽之一，拥有一个铁路机车工厂，还有铁路通往的的喀喀湖畔的瓜基港与行政首都拉巴斯。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1002035","articleTitle":"比亞查","sourceRevision":94696862,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 比亚查","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AF%94%E4%BA%9E%E6%9F%A5"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94696862"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1002035"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159132217","name":"基梅","country":"BOL","lat":-16.98001,"lon":-67.22002,"kind":"city","region":"BO-L","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159132223","name":"拉拉瓜","country":"BOL","lat":-18.42003,"lon":-66.64,"kind":"city","region":"BO-P","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159132229","name":"溫西亞","country":"BOL","lat":-18.47,"lon":-66.57003,"kind":"city","region":"BO-P","rank":8,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159132231","name":"烏尤尼","country":"BOL","lat":-20.46001,"lon":-66.82999,"kind":"city","region":"BO-P","rank":8,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"烏尤尼 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"乌尤尼座落于海拔的广袤平原之上，东边有多座高山。\n乌尤尼其中一个知名观光景点是旧式铁路列车的墓地，该处位于市区外3公里处。\n位于玻利维亚西南部的乌尤尼附近，是世界最大的盐沼，东西长约250公里，南北宽约100公里，面积达10,582平方公里，盛产岩盐与石膏。","culture":"乌尤尼以贸易站的身份始建于1890年，镇上有著一条市场长街。\n市区内有四条铁路线交会，分别来自拉巴斯、卡拉马（智利）、波托西和比亚松。","see":"当地人民也有兴建成博物馆的呼声，但并无下文。","scope":"reference","qid":"Q1014511","articleTitle":"烏尤尼","sourceRevision":90105238,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 乌尤尼","https://zh.w